# Intentionally keep index.html: this project delivers a self-contained build.
# Also keep source/assets/, source/*.json, models/kingspec-showroom.glb,
# primary .blend projects, models/tex/, screenshots and review deliverables.
# No blanket dist/, build/, GLB, image, JSON, EXR or .blend exclusion.
